inutes\nJune 2024 Minutes\nMarch 2024 Minutes\nFebruary 2024 Minutes\nJanuary 2024 Minutes\n2023 City Council Minutes\nDecember 2023 Minutes\nNovember 2023 Minutes\nOctober 2023 Minutes\nSeptember 2023 Special Meeting\nSeptember 2023 Minutes\nAugust 2023 Minutes\nJuly 2023 Minutes\nJune 2023 Minutes\nMay 2023 Minutes\nApril 2023 Minutes\nMarch 2023 Minutes\nFebruary 2023 Minutes\nJanuary 2023 Minutes\nJanuary 2023 Special Meeting Minutes\nCity Ordinances\nCHAPTER 6 ZONING AND LAND USE\nGalvanized Steel Resolution.\nTourism\nRecreation\nEvents\nChamber Awards Banquet\nContact\nWelcome to LaMoure, North Dakota!\nWe are glad to have you visit us. There is so much to see and do here, whether you’re one of our many fine residents or just checking in with family, friends or relatives.\nLiving in LaMoure is like getting back to the “REAL” world. A world where we enjoy the beautiful sunrises and sunsets over a field of golden wheat or take in the breathtaking northern lights dancing in the night sky among the stars. Nature doesn’t get any better than this! In addition to the beauty of North Dakota, there are lots of things to do. LaMoure is like heaven for the outdoors man or woman.\nThank you for visiting!\nLaMoure Community\nLaMoure Community Calendar\n\nFull Calendar of Events\n\nLaMoure Public School\n\nEconomic Development\nFacebook\nCopyright 2025 - Privacy Policy\nWebsite designed & hosted by Simple Wolf, LLC",
